Package: klamathWaterData
Title: Klamath Basin Water Quality and Hydrology Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Description: A collection of curated, analysis-ready datasets describing water
    quality, streamflow, lake and reservoir water levels, wetland surface
    water extent, and hydrologic monitoring station locations across the
    Klamath Basin. Data are sourced from USGS, the Water Quality Portal (WQX),
    USBR Hydromet, Oregon Water Resources Department, and the Intermountain West Joint Venture Wetland Extent
    Tool (WET) raster products.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
LazyData: true
